# Deployed to teedlo.com/1/.htaccess — NOT this repo's own .htaccess.
#
# The pages moved from /1/ to /kmhd/. The old copies are still sitting in
# /1/ because the deploy runs without --delete, so without this they would
# go on serving a duplicate of the site frozen at the last /1/ deploy —
# indexable, and drifting further from /kmhd/ with every release. This
# points /1/ at the real thing instead of leaving a stale twin behind.
#
# (Nothing depends on the old URL — it was never shared — so deleting the
# /1/ files outright would work equally well; this just avoids doing
# anything destructive on the server to achieve it.)
RedirectMatch 301 ^/1/?$ /kmhd/
RedirectMatch 301 ^/1/(.+)$ /kmhd/$1
